      "theory": "The commodification of organizational headcount through predictive AI telemetry and external management consulting. Efficiency audits treat knowledge capital as an expendable line item, converting human institutional memory into synthetic training weights for autonomous pipeline tools.",
      "summary": "The \"Consultant\" arrives, but it isn't a human being. It represents the \"Black Box\" algorithm hired by the Board to cut costs. The song describes a \"mandatory meeting\" where the Son sits across from a figure (or a screen) that speaks in the language of pure capital efficiency. The lyrics reveal the ultimate irony: The Son's meticulous documentation (from Digital Taylorism) is now being ingested by the machine to render him obsolete.",
      "cleanLyrics": "[Intro]\nWe have reviewed the logs.\nWe have processed the data.\n\n[Verse 1]\nHe walks into the room but he doesn't shake my hand\nHe is holding a tablet with a graph of the land\nHe wears a suit that costs more than my car\nBut his eyes are dead like a dying star\nHe says \"We love the work you did in phase one\nBut the capital cycle has only begun\nWe are looking for synergies we are looking for fat\nAnd I am afraid you are the one sitting on the mat\"\n\n[Chorus]\nIt is just Optimization\nIt is just a calculation\nWe do not hate you we do not care\nWe only measure the value of the air\nYou are a cost center you are a drag\nYou are a red flag in the system tag\nOptimization.\n\n[Verse 2]\nHe looks at the wiki where I wrote the code\nHe looks at the manual for the heavy load\nHe smiles a smile that is made of glass\nAnd says \"Thank you for teaching the model to pass\"\nI realize now with a sick little fear\nWhy they made me document every single year\nI wasn't writing a guide for a new hire to see\nI was writing the code that deletes me\n\n[Bridge]\nYou trained the dog that bites your hand!\nYou built the castle on the sinking sand!\nI gave you the data!\nI gave you the map!\nAnd now I am caught in the logic trap!\n\n[Chorus]\nIt is just Optimization\nIt is just a calculation\nWe do not hate you we do not care\nWe only measure the value of the air\nYou are a cost center you are a drag\nYou are a red flag in the system tag\nOptimization.\n\n[Outro]\nRedundancy identified.\nRole eliminated.\nAccess revoked.\nPlease return your badge."
