      "theory": "The complete alienation of the modern termination ritual: mass terminations conducted via muted video calls, automated single-sign-on access revocations, and algorithmic severance notifications. Physical eviction from the workplace is replaced by instantaneous digital disenfranchisement.",
      "summary": "This track captures the specific horror of the modern \"Mass Layoff.\" It is based on the real-world \"Bird\" layoffs where 400 people were fired in a 2-minute webinar with the chat disabled. The song is short, brutal, and glitchy. It focuses on the powerlessness of the employee: muted mic, disabled camera, pre-recorded message. The Electric Cello mimics the sound of a \"dial tone\" or a \"connection lost\" signal.",
